<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ODM lifts interim shr, no div.</title>
<headline>ODM lifts interim shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr - headline (cts)   18.12   vs  5.45</p>
<p>    Shr - diluted (cts)    15.34   vs  4.65</p>
<p>    Retained profit	   6.61   vs  1.99</p>
<p>    Before tax		  6.61   vs  1.99</p>
<p>    Interest received	 1.85   vs  1.06</p>
<p>    Depreciation		2.60   vs  2.46</p>
<p>    Exploration exp	   2.33   vs  1.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		   22.19   vs 12.33</p>
<p>Full name: Ocean Diamond Mining Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said diamond production for the second half of the year was expected to achieve the targeted 55,000 carats and earnings should be at least equal to those in the first half. Because of additional prospecting areas, exploration expenditure was expected to increase.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
